      "type": "Talk",
      "properties": {
        "abstract": "Recently Apache Solr has been integrated into the Hadoop ecosystem to provide full text search at \"big data\" scale. This talk will give an overview of how Cloudera tackled integrating Solr into the Hadoop ecosystem and highlight some of the design decisions and future plans. Learn how Solr is going to get closer to Hadoop, which contributions are going to what project and how you should consider tackling search at Hadoop scale in the future.",
